    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'ACHERON PLANETARY DATA


    CONT-01A  BLACKSPIRE CONTINENT

    REG-01A  Blackspire Range     | BIO-01A  Volcanic Highlands

    ISL-01A  Blackspire Expanse    | Mountain / Industrial

    Combined arms, elevation, industrial combat | Dominion of Acheron


    CONT-01A  BLACKSPIRE CONTINENT

    REG-01B  Obsidian Lowlands    | BIO-01B  Basalt Coast

    ISL-01B  Ashen Wastes          | Mountain / Mining

    Ground warfare, logistics, chokepoints | Riftguard Coalition


    CONT-01B  RIFTFORGE CONTINENT

    REG-01C  Rift Plateau Zone     | BIO-01C  Charred Desert

    ISL-01C  Obsidian Coast         | Urban

    Close-range urban warfare      | Obsidian Compact


    CONT-01C  ASHFALL CONTINENT

    REG-01D  Ashen Frontier        | BIO-01D  Industrial Badlands

    ISL-01D  Rift Plateau           | Volcanic / Industrial

    Harsh terrain, visibility, environmental effects | Ashen Sovereignty'
